<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington started a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington started a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan started coverage of Burlington Northern Santa Fe Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates 1997 earnings at $6.55 per share, 1998 at $7.85 per share.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $102, applying current price to earnings multiple of 13 to 1998 earnings estimate.</p>
<p>-- Said expects first quarter earnings to decline by five percent versus last year to $1.15 per share due to severe weather in Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 84-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
